r projection of $\\overset{\\to }{PQ}$ onto the normal vector of the plane:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}d & =|{\\text{comp}}_{n}\\,\\overset{\\to }{PQ}| \\\\  & =\\frac{|\\overset{\\to }{PQ}\\cdot n|}{|n|} \\\\  & =\\frac{|3\\cdot (-4)+3\\cdot (-2)+3\\cdot 2|}{\\sqrt{(-4)^{2}+(-2)^{2}+{2}^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{|-12-6+6|}{\\sqrt{16+4+4}} \\\\  & =\\frac{|\\,-12\\,|}{\\sqrt{24}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{6}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139536190 true] [17592186388086 1000 #edb/ref 17592186388087 13194139536190 true] [17592186388086 1000 #edb/ref 17592186388088 13194139536190 true] [17592186388086 1000 #edb/ref 17592186388089 13194139536190 true] [17592186388086 1000 #edb/ref 17592186388090 13194139536190 true] [17592186388086 1000 #edb/ref 17592186388091 13194139536190 true] [17592186388086 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139536190 true] [17592186388086 1041 "selection" 13194139536190 true] [17592186388086 1104 #edb/ref 17592186388089 13194139536190 true] [17592186388086 1110 #uuid "57b99d77-9bee-5bb6-97d4-878cc0b372d9" 13194139536190 true] [17592186388087 1034 "12" 13194139536190 true] [17592186388087 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536190 true] [17592186388087 1111 #uuid "738fe9d0-29e4-585e-96c3-a87a2ba470c8" 13194139536190 true] [17592186388088 1034 "4\\sqrt{6}" 13194139536190 true] [17592186388088 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536190 true] [17592186388088 1111 #uuid "3a2d4d69-26e7-530d-a76b-d30a13e39d43" 13194139536190 true] [17592186388089 1034 "\\sqrt{6}" 13194139536190 true] [17592186388089 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536190 true] [17592186388089 1111 #uuid "9360ea04-76db-54eb-b194-f517cb548b16" 13194139536190 true] [17592186388090 1034 "6" 13194139536190 true] [17592186388090 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536190 true] [17592186388090 1111 #uuid "07bbc60f-8158-5f0a-a653-c579ea16a240" 13194139536190 true] [17592186388091 1034 "2\\sqrt{6}" 13194139536190 true] [17592186388091 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536190 true] [17592186388091 1111 #uuid "